	<row id="msg_0605_T26FS0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your homies know the move for\ncarryin’ people on water yet?\fHydrant Wave?\rYou gon’ need it. Uber don’t go on\nwater.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0605_T26FS0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My BUTTERFREE came from my boo\noverseas.\rIt brought Mail from him.\fWanna know what it say?\rLet’s see...\rNOPE! It’s private! It’s NASTY! I\nmean... sweet. It’s sweet.</language>
	</row>
